OL,3,GNEWSAUnder-16s could be banned from
OL,4,Abuying energy drinks in Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British Soft Drinks Association
OL,7,Fsaid the proposed ban was "unnecessary
OL,8,Fand not supported by robust evidence of
OL,9,Foverconsumption or harm".
